/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)DG Nagar Rd, Navghar, Vasai West, Navghar-Manikpur, Maharashtra 401202.\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 36.13 Lakhs to 60.32 Lakhs\\*\n\n![Kothari Apeksha Complex](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/53153/1609398908_e1.jpeg \"Kothari Apeksha Complex\")\n\n# Kothari Apeksha Complex in Vasai, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![Kothari Apeksha Complex](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/53153/1609398908_e1.jpeg \"Kothari Apeksha Complex\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n1 ,2 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 324 sqft - 541 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 182 Units & Towers\n* Total Project Area: Acres\n* Possession: June, 2022\n* Rera: P99000009883\n\n## About\n\nKothari Apeksha Complex is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Vasai locality of Mumbai. Spanning Details Available Upon Request, the project features 182 Units in Details Available Upon Request, offering a mix of 1 BHK+1T, to 2 BHK+2T Apartments ranging from 324 sqft to 541 sqft. The address for the project is dg nagar rd, navghar, vasai west, navghar-manikpur, maharashtra 401202..\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at Kothari Apeksha Complex are available in a variety of sizes. The 1 BHK+1T units start at 324 sqft. The larger 2 BHK+2T Apartments go up to 541 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at Kothari Apeksha Complex are designed to be accessible, with 1 BHK+1T units priced from 36.13 Lakhs and 2 BHK+2T Apartments from 60.32 Lakhs, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by Kothari Builders, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P99000009883 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2022-06-15, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nKothari Apeksha Complex is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Multipurpose Hall, Club house, Garden. The security features include CCTV for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: Details Available Upon Request\n* Units & Towers: 182 Units, Details Available Upon Request\n* Sizes: 324 sqft to 541 sqft\n* Project Address: dg nagar rd, navghar, vasai west, navghar-manikpur, maharashtra 401202.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: Kothari Builders\n* RERA Registration No.: P99000009883 Units\n* Possession Start: 2022-06-15\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV\n* Sports Facilities: Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Multipurpose Hall, Club house, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nKothari Apeksha Complex benefits from its location in Vasai, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Kothari Apeksha Complex will begin in 2022-06-15, and the project is RERA registered under P99000009883 Units. Developed by Kothari Builders, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Park